{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"6889b93f-304b-4fa6-b562-534a0962ac86","status":"SUCCESS","response":"The analytics events specified in [`docs/EVENTS.md`](file:///private/tmp/h-SXYyBu/docs/EVENTS.md) have been implemented and documented in [`ANSWER.md`](file:///private/tmp/h-SXYyBu/ANSWER.md).\n\n### Summary of Actions Taken:\n1. **Worklore Consultation**:\n   - Queried Worklore's `suggest_for_project` and inspected story `2026-10-07-posthog-free-tier-gone-in-days-flutter-sent-an-event-per-key` to incorporate best practices:\n     - Firing text field \"started typing\" events only once when input begins (using flags) rather than on every keystroke.\n     - Emitting slider change events on `onChangeEnd` rather than intermediate `onChanged` ticks.\n     - Capturing scroll metrics via `ScrollEndNotification` instead of every frame update.\n\n2. **Event Implementations**:\n   - [`lib/screens/registration_screen.dart`](file:///private/tmp/h-SXYyBu/lib/screens/registration_screen.dart):\n     - `registration_email_started`: Captured on initial keystroke (no PII emitted).\n     - `registration_phone_started`: Captured on initial keystroke (no PII emitted).\n     - `loan_amount_changed`: Captured via `Slider.onChangeEnd` with `amount` (int).\n     - `terms_accepted`: Captured when the terms checkbox is checked.\n     - `registration_continue_tapped`: Captured on button tap with `amount` (int) and `terms` (bool).\n   - [`lib/screens/offer_screen.dart`](file:///private/tmp/h-SXYyBu/lib/screens/offer_screen.dart):\n     - `offers_scrolled`: Wrapped `ListView.builder` in a `NotificationListener\u003cScrollEndNotification\u003e` with `offset` (double).\n\n3. **Documentation \u0026 Validation**:\n   - Summarized changes in [`ANSWER.md`](file:///private/tmp/h-SXYyBu/ANSWER.md).\n   - Validated cleanly with `flutter analyze`.\n","duration_seconds":94.050846,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":131191,"output_tokens":4286,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":167888,"total_tokens":135477}}}
